0..72 Comment "// A coherence cell: a rule between rules, its source a composite of two"
73..143 Comment "// laws spelled with `Path.step` in parentheses. The laws here nest no"
144..218 Comment "// operation, so the cell is the only member the cell layer does not read."
219..221 Comment "//"
222..288 Comment "// A category\'s own triangle and pentagon, over the composition of"
289..361 Comment "// `cat-shape.gandr`, return here once the cell layer reads an operation"
362..381 Comment "// nested in a law:"
382..384 Comment "//"
385..456 Comment "//   rule triangle : (Path.step(assoc(f, id(b), g), comp(f, unitL(g))))"
457..486 Comment "//     ==> comp(unitR(f), g);"
487..552 Comment "//   rule pentagon : (Path.step(assoc(comp(f, g), h, k), assoc(f,"
553..574 Comment "//   g, comp(h, k))))"
575..652 Comment "//     ==> (Path.step(Path.step(comp(assoc(f, g, h), k), assoc(f, comp(g, h),"
653..691 Comment "//     k)), comp(f, assoc(g, h, k))));"
692..694 Comment "//"
695..710 Comment "// - see: #1510"
712..783 Comment "/// Two steps and the shortcut between their ends: the cell relates the"
784..827 Comment "/// composite of the steps to the shortcut."
